@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"原本的【我】<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_19_01\">什么都没有</link>……！<br>总是迎合周围的人，<br>只会傻乎乎地笑，<br>有一天过一天……！|#0205Trial19_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以你问大叔我<br>那么复杂的<br>问题……<br>我也搞不明白啊！|#0205Trial19_Miria004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是这边的人，<br>那边的人，<br>所有的人……！|#0205Trial19_Miria005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆SNSイジメを思い出してる

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:都自以为是地<br>拉帮结派、划分敌我，<br>既阴险又阴惨还阴湿……！|#0205Trial19_Miria006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"这么<link=\"Objection_02_05_19_02\">恶趣味的事</link><br>不要扯上我好吗！|#0205Trial19_Miria007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:大叔我……<br>只是个随处可见的<br>普通学生而已啊……！？|#0205Trial19_Miria008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Determined_Close
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"明明，<br>只要<link=\"Objection_02_05_19_03\">无视</link>大叔我<br>就好了……！|#0205Trial19_Miria009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
